{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00609",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 12.02,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm so worried. I've not wanted any food and I've lost weight, and I don't know what's happening to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.58,
      "end_seconds": 22.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Come and sit down, Mr Okonkwo. We'll look into it together. Who's with you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 25.22,
      "end_seconds": 36.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "I'm Dee, I'm his carer. I come in each morning and evening. I brought him because I'm worried too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.59,
      "end_seconds": 50.52,
      "duration_seconds": 11.93,
      "text": "Thank you, Dee, that's helpful. Mr Okonkwo, let me check I have it right. You're not wanting food and you've lost weight."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.46,
      "end_seconds": 56.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Yes. Is it serious? Tell me the truth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.5,
      "end_seconds": 68.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "I'll tell you everything as I learn it. First, how long has the appetite been poor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 71.25,
      "end_seconds": 79.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "About three weeks. He leaves nearly the whole plate, and he used to love his stew."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.48,
      "end_seconds": 89.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Three weeks, yes, it sounds right. Though it feels longer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.23,
      "end_seconds": 96.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "And the weight. When did you first notice that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.61,
      "end_seconds": 106.65,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "Oh, I couldn't tell you. My trousers were loose one day and I couldn't say when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.34,
      "end_seconds": 113.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "That's all right. Dee, have you noticed a change?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 114.18,
      "end_seconds": 126.68,
      "duration_seconds": 12.5,
      "text": "His belt's gone in two holes, but I only started keeping an eye on it recently, so I can't give a date either."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.38,
      "end_seconds": 135.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "So the weight loss has crept up and you can't pin down when. Fair enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.72,
      "end_seconds": 145.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "And I'm very tired, doctor. Very tired, all day, even after sleeping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.16,
      "end_seconds": 150.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Very tired all day. Noted. Any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.11,
      "end_seconds": 154.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "No vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.86,
      "end_seconds": 160.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "And does it hurt when you swallow food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.18,
      "end_seconds": 168.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "No, no, swallowing's fine. I just don't fancy anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.68,
      "end_seconds": 175.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Okay, that's helpful. Now, what tablets do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.8,
      "end_seconds": 182.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "The one for my heart. Dee, what's it called?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 184.83,
      "end_seconds": 190.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Bisoprolol. 2.5 mg, every morning. I give it to him myself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.52,
      "end_seconds": 197.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Bisoprolol, 2.5 mg every morning. Any other long-term problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.03,
      "end_seconds": 204.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "High blood pressure. Years and years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.91,
      "end_seconds": 210.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Right. Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.2,
      "end_seconds": 224.46,
      "duration_seconds": 12.26,
      "text": "Oh dear. I think I came out in something once, years ago, after an antibiotic. But I can't remember which one, or what happened."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.14,
      "end_seconds": 236.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "So a possible reaction to an antibiotic, but you're not sure which. We'll be careful, and I'll make a note."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.42,
      "end_seconds": 242.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Is that bad? Should I be frightened?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.78,
      "end_seconds": 252.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "Not at all, it's simply a precaution. Now, you live on your own, I believe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.69,
      "end_seconds": 262.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Yes, since my wife passed. The house is very quiet, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.0,
      "end_seconds": 281.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "I'm sorry. Dee comes twice a day, and that's a great help. Let me check your observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.56,
      "end_seconds": 307.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "Blood pressure 108 over 64. Pulse 96. Temperature 36.9. Oxygen 97 percent. Breathing 16. And your weight is 58 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.54,
      "end_seconds": 313.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Is it very bad? Fifty-eight kilos is so low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.93,
      "end_seconds": 330.49,
      "duration_seconds": 14.56,
      "text": "Those numbers are a little on the low side for blood pressure and a little fast for the pulse. Nothing frightening on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.0,
      "end_seconds": 334.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Oh, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.42,
      "end_seconds": 350.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Open your mouth for me, please, and stick your tongue out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.22,
      "end_seconds": 369.31,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Your mouth is rather dry. Now let me press your tummy. Tell me if it hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.76,
      "end_seconds": 374.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Ooh, that's all right. Does it feel odd?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.97,
      "end_seconds": 384.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and not tender. That's a good sign."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.95,
      "end_seconds": 391.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "What do you think it is, doctor? Is it cancer?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.83,
      "end_seconds": 408.05,
      "duration_seconds": 16.22,
      "text": "I understand why you ask. I don't want to guess about that today. What I think most likely is that you're mildly dehydrated because you've hardly been eating or drinking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.74,
      "end_seconds": 413.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Mildly dehydrated. And that makes me tired?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.52,
      "end_seconds": 426.31,
      "duration_seconds": 11.79,
      "text": "It can. So we'll deal with it in steps. Today I'd like to order some blood tests, to check your kidneys, salts and blood count."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 427.12,
      "end_seconds": 431.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Can I take him down for those straight after?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.14,
      "end_seconds": 445.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.51,
      "text": "Yes, please do. I'd also like to arrange a chest X-ray at the same time, since we're checking everything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 446.8,
      "end_seconds": 450.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "An X-ray too? Why the chest?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.12,
      "end_seconds": 461.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "Because weight loss deserves a thorough look, and it's quick. It doesn't mean I've found anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 463.96,
      "end_seconds": 468.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "All right. If you think it's best."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 469.76,
      "end_seconds": 480.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "I do. In the meantime, Dee, small sips of fluid through the day, and little snacks rather than big plates."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 482.62,
      "end_seconds": 488.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "I can do that. Soup, yoghurt, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 491.16,
      "end_seconds": 495.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "And a nice cup of tea, perhaps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 498.21,
      "end_seconds": 507.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "Tea counts. So, tests today, little and often with food and fluids. Does that make sense, Mr Okonkwo?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 509.16,
      "end_seconds": 516.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Yes. Tests today, little and often. Thank you for being kind, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 517.31,
      "end_seconds": 522.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Come on, Mr Okonkwo, I'll walk you down."
    }
  ]
}
